                                MGNY Consulting provides affordable housing and tax solutions to help navigate complex property regulations. As part of
                                creating an engaging website experience, we produced relatable storytelling, brand strategy, custom illustrations, and
                                SEO-friendly site architecture.
                            </h3>
                        </div>
                    </div>
